          "gatherSets": "Gather all cards from the following encounter sets: _The Apiary_, _Cosmic Legacy_, _Elder Mist_, _The Inescapable_, _Pilgrims_, _Dark Cult_, and _Striking Fear_. These sets are indicated by the following icons:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/the-apiary.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/cosmic-legacy.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/elder-mist.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/the-inescapable.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/pilgrims.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/dark-cult.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/striking-fear.png' /></section>",
