          "setCardsAside": "Set each of the following aside, out of play: each Apiary location, the Grotesque Amalgam and the double-sided Squamous Parasite {'{'}runeT{'}'} enemies, the Maria Rivera, Ancient Relic {'{'}runeS{'}'}, and Grisly “Mask” story assets, the Pilgrims and The Inescapable encounter sets, and each copy of the Parasitic Transformation weakness.",
