          "gatherSets": "Gather all cards from the following encounter sets: *Obsidian Canyons*, *Cosmic Legacy*, *Elder Mist*, *The Inescapable*, *R’lyeh*, *Star Spawn*, *Ancient Evils*, *Chilling Cold*, *Nightgaunts*, and *Striking Fear*. These sets are indicated by the following icons:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/obsidian-canyons.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/cosmic-legacy.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/elder-mist.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/the-inescapable.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/rlyeh.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/star-spawn.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/ancient-evils.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/chilling-cold.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/nightgaunts.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/striking-fear.png' /></section>Set all 14 cards in the *Ancient Evils*, *Chilling Cold*, and *Striking Fear* encounter sets aside, out of play, as _“open sky”_ (see _Open Sky_).",
