            "buildActAgendaDeck": "Build the act and agenda decks using agenda 1a—“Encroaching Storms,” act 1a—“Scouring the Spires,” act 2a—“Deadly Skies,” and act 3a—“Return to the Shoreline.” Remove each other act and agenda from the game.",
