            "checkCampaignLogInescapable": "Check your Campaign Log. *If the creature was defeated*, remove *The Inescapable* encounter set from the game. Otherwise, spawn The Inescapable enemy at the location farthest from all investigators, exhausted.",
            "chooseExpeditionAsset": "In player order, each player may choose 1 earned _Artifact_ asset or 1 _Item_ asset from the *Expedition* encounter set to begin in play under their control. This set is indicated by the following icon:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/tdc_expedition.png' /></section>",
