          "chooseExpeditionAsset": "In player order, each player may choose 1 earned _Artifact_ asset or 1 _Item_ asset from the _Expedition_ encounter set to begin in play under their control. This set is indicated by the following icon:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/tdc_expedition.png' /></section>",
          "removeTheInescapable": "Check your Campaign Log. If _the creature was defeated_, remove The Inescapable encounter set from the game.",
