          "chooseExpeditionAssetQuestion": "Choose an earned Artifact asset, or an Item asset from the Expedition encounter set, to begin in play under your control.",
          "noExpeditionAsset": "Do not take an Artifact or Expedition asset.",
          "deactivateYourLocation": "Deactivate your location."
